    "## 🎹 AI Song Builder\n",
    "Upload a vocal or melody reference inside the Gradio UI. The builder can generate selected **Intro / Verse / Chorus / Bridge / Outro** sections independently and crossfade them into a single sketch. The current sketch cap is 90 seconds.\n",
    "\n",
    "For the first real run, use a GPU runtime and short section durations (for example 4–8 seconds). The builder returns a final WAV plus a ZIP containing the individual sections and a JSON manifest."
   ]
  },
